A false memory is just a reconstruction operator converging on the wrong attractor, because the constraints were insufficient.

23:56.480 --> 24:04.740
Personal history, biological history, universal history, they are all just the collections of traces currently available for reconstruction.

24:05.120 --> 24:08.060
Okay, my brain is officially spinning, but we have to keep moving.

