24:17.060 --> 24:17.580
Exactly.

24:18.080 --> 24:22.980
And this is where Flyxion takes a sledgehammer to the foundations of physics and information theory.

24:23.560 --> 24:26.200
I've updated the backdrop again to reflect this shift.

24:26.200 --> 24:26.680
Oh, nice.

24:26.780 --> 24:29.100
