Let's dive into how this AI actually works because it perfectly maps on defliction's theory.

28:37.040 --> 28:39.500
So flow matching is used in computational biology.

28:39.920 --> 28:41.460
You have two massive data sets.

28:42.000 --> 28:45.260
Data set A is a distribution of cells from a healthy patient.

28:45.260 --> 28:50.000
Data set B is a distribution of cells from a patient with a specific disease.

28:50.180 --> 28:54.360
And these exist in high-dimensional space like we're tracking thousands of genes per cell.

28:54.700 --> 28:54.980
Right.

