But Flyxion points out the AI isn't storing states at all.

29:09.140 --> 29:09.620
Not at all.

29:09.880 --> 29:12.180
Flow matching works by using optimal transport theory.

29:12.180 --> 29:16.600
It calculates the most efficient mathematical path, the optimal vector field,

29:16.760 --> 29:21.620
to transform the probability distribution of healthy cells into the distribution of six cells.

29:22.060 --> 29:23.820
It's drawing a map of the transformation.

29:24.640 --> 29:29.120
But why does the AI's math map actually mean anything in reality?

29:29.440 --> 29:37.000
Because the model only succeeds if biologically relevant distinctions survive the mathematical transformation path it learns.

29:37.000 --> 29:38.460
Oh, so it's proving persistence.

29:38.840 --> 29:39.080
Yes.

29:39.420 --> 29:48.480
It maps the cells successfully because it is learning the actual topography of how recoverable distinction is transported through biological space.

29:48.820 --> 29:52.660
The AI model is literally acting as a scientific explanation.

29:52.920 --> 29:53.420
Exactly.

29:53.840 --> 29:58.780
It is a repair operator that restores structural alignment between two entirely different states,

29:59.200 --> 30:02.840
proving that the underlying distinctions persist across the disease transformation.

