32:35.760 --> 32:38.900
Flyxion solves this by laying out a reconstructive hierarchy.

32:39.420 --> 32:44.360
It is an epistemic ladder mapping how we build robust realities out of fragile traces.

32:44.360 --> 32:45.480
Let's climb it.

32:45.780 --> 32:47.640
We start at the very bottom, level one.

32:47.860 --> 32:53.980
Level one is information, which as we defined earlier, is just raw, recoverable distinction.

32:54.620 --> 32:55.020
Correct.

